WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,880
I'll just say

2
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,960
I spent real money on it back then.

3
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,600
Not like those shabby wooden houses of yours

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,440
The heavy snow is shaken by the wind

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,720
What's wrong with it?

6
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,600
Master, everything is okay in He Mansion

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,560
It's a side room on the west side

8
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:18,480
Crushed a few pieces of baby

9
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,520
There is nothing wrong with the residence.

10
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:22,590
Uncle, did you hear that?

11
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,110
What did I tell you yesterday?

12
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,190
My He family's house

13
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:26,150
blue brick south wood

14
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:28,070
How can it be compared to those poor people’s shabby houses?

15
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:29,950
Do you still remember?

16
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:31,390
The boy from the Mu family said a few days ago

17
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,590
We can no longer live in wooden houses.

18
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:34,070
Sooner or later the snow will collapse.

19
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:37,220
Is it really as nonsense as he said?

20
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,620
That fool is really dangerous.

21
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:40,220
You can also give the house to the former shopkeeper for free

22
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,460
Go get a load of useless poisonous stones to cover his nonsense.

23
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,580
You can also take a break

24
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,780
But your house

25
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,180
Didn’t it all collapse too?

26
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:48,140
Now we don’t have a place to stay.

27
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,470
The weather is at night

28
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,670
But what?

29
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:51,950
A place to stay now

30
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:52,950
But where else can we go?
